        {"zh": "黑暗里，它的分身现身！", "en": "A clone appears in the dark."},
        {"zh": "土面裂开，一根手指先出", "en": "The soil cracks; a finger comes first."},
        {"zh": "本体丢下一具根身", "en": "My master drops a body of roots."},
