        {"zh": "我又被种下了一次", "en": "I have been planted once again."},
        {"zh": "泥土翻滚，分身成形", "en": "The dirt rolls; the clone takes shape."},
        {"zh": "深处传来本体的低语", "en": "My master whispers from the depths."}
